{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/metacodable\/limitations"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"All the usage limitations for ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Limitations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Currently all the limitations of this library and possible workarounds and future plans are listed below. Most of these limitations depend on the data "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" provides to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable"},{"type":"text","text":" to perform macro expansion."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Why strict typing is necessary?","anchor":"Why-strict-typing-is-necessary"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Swift"},{"text":" compiler doesn’t provide any type inference data to macros, so to know type of variables ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Codable(commonStrategies:)","isActive":true},{"text":" needs types to be explicitly specified in the code. i.e. following code will not work and will cause error while macro expansion:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@Codable","struct Model {","    let value = 1","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is due to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Codable(commonStrategies:)"},{"type":"text","text":" unable to determine the type of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value"},{"type":"text","text":", by specifying the type explicitly expansion is performed successfully:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@Codable","struct Model {","    let value: Int = 1","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Why super class Codable conformance not detected?","anchor":"Why-super-class-Codable-conformance-not-detected"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The ability to pass conformance data to macro for classes when performing member attribute expansion was introduced in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-evolution\/blob\/main\/proposals\/0407-member-macro-conformances.md"},{"type":"text","text":". Please make sure to upgrade to this version to have this working."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Even with this it is unable for ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Codable(commonStrategies:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" to get clear indication where conformance to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is implemented by current class or the super class. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Codable(commonStrategies:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" checks current class for the conformance implementation by checking implementation functions and the check will not work if some ","type":"text"},{"code":"typealias","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" used for ","type":"text"},{"code":"Decoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"Encoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in implementation function definition.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Why enum-case associated values decoding\/encoding are not customizable?","anchor":"Why-enum-case-associated-values-decodingencoding-are-not-customizable"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The goal of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is to allow same level of customization for enum-case associated values as it is allowed for ","type":"text"},{"code":"struct","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"class","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" member properties. Unfortunately, as of now, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" doesn’t allow macro attributes (or any attributes) to be attached per enum-case arguments.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/forums.swift.org\/t\/attached-macro-support-for-enum-case-arguments\/67952","isActive":true},{"text":", you can support this pitch on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Swift"},{"text":" forum if this feature will benefit you.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current workaround is to extract enum-case arguments to separate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"struct"},{"type":"text","text":" and have the customization options in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"struct"},{"type":"text","text":" itself. i.e. since following isn’t possible:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@Codable","enum SomeEnum {","    case string(@CodedAt(\"data\") String)","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"you can convert it to:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@Codable","enum SomeEnum {","    case string(StringData)","","    @Codable","    struct StringData {","        let data: String","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Why actor conformance to Encodable not generated?","anchor":"Why-actor-conformance-to-Encodable-not-generated"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For "},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Codable(commonStrategies:)"},{"type":"text","text":" generates "},{"code":"Decodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance, while "},{"code":"Encodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance isn’t generated, only "},{"code":"encode(to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method implementation is generated which is isolated to "},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To generate "},{"code":"Encodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance, the "},{"code":"encode(to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method must be "},{"code":"nonisolated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and since "},{"code":"encode(to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method must be synchronous making it "},{"code":"nonisolated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" will prevent accessing mutable properties."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Due to these limitations, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable"},{"text":" conformance isn’t generated, users have to implement the conformance manually.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Why MetaProtocolCodable plugin can’t scan Xcode target dependencies?","anchor":"Why-MetaProtocolCodable-plugin-cant-scan-Xcode-target-dependencies"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Currently Swift Package Manager always returns empty list for Xcode target dependencies as noted in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-package-manager\/issues\/6003","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Hence "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MetaProtocolCodable"},{"type":"text","text":" can currently only scan the files from the target or from the project including the target."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Why macro is breaking with SwiftData class?","anchor":"Why-macro-is-breaking-with-SwiftData-class"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Currently during certain customization in SwiftUI, compiler is sending no protocol data to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Codable(commonStrategies:)"},{"text":". Due to this, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Codable(commonStrategies:)"},{"text":" tries to find ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":" protocol implementation for the class. If no implementation found, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Codable(commonStrategies:)"},{"text":" assumes class inherits conformance from super class, and generates implementation accordingly causing issues like ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/SwiftyLab\/MetaCodable\/issues\/56"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Until this is fixes from Swift compiler, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/Inherits(decodable:encodable:)","isActive":true},{"text":" macro can be used to indicate explicitly that class doesn’t inherit ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":" conformance.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Why IgnoreEncoding(if:) not supported for types and MetaProtocolCodable plugin?","anchor":"Why-IgnoreEncodingif-not-supported-for-types-and-MetaProtocolCodable-plugin"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As of writing, Swift has an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift\/issues\/68158"},{"type":"text","text":" which causes error when "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/IgnoreEncoding(if:)-7toka"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/IgnoreEncoding(if:)-1iuvv"},{"type":"text","text":" is attached to a type declaration. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/forums.swift.org\/t\/circular-reference-error-when-using-keypaths-to-properties-with-macros-bug-or-expected-behaviour\/69162"},{"type":"text","text":", and once fixed this feature will be supported by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MetaProtocolCodable"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin as well."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/tutorials\/Usage"]}],"metadata":{"title":"Limitations","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"MetaCodable"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://MetaCodable/documentation/MetaCodable":{"type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Supercharge "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Swift"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":" implementations with macros."}],"url":"\/documentation\/metacodable","title":"MetaCodable","kind":"symbol"},"https://github.com/apple/swift/issues/68158":{"type":"link","title":"existing bug","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift\/issues\/68158","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"existing bug"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift\/issues\/68158"},"doc://MetaCodable/documentation/MetaCodable/IgnoreEncoding(if:)-7toka":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/IgnoreEncoding(if:)-7toka","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"IgnoreEncoding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"if"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T","preciseIdentifier":"s:11MetaCodable1TL_xmfp"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/metacodable\/ignoreencoding(if:)-7toka","abstract":[{"text":"Indicates the field needs to be encoded only if provided condition","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is not satisfied.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"IgnoreEncoding(if:)"},"doc://MetaCodable/tutorials/Usage":{"kind":"overview","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MetaCodable"},{"text":" supercharges ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Swift"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":" implementations with macros. Remove previous boiler-plate for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":" implementations and create ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":" conformances faster than ever before.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/usage","identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/tutorials\/Usage","role":"overview","type":"topic","title":"Discover MetaCodable"},"doc://MetaCodable/documentation/MetaCodable/IgnoreEncoding(if:)-1iuvv":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MetaCodable\/documentation\/MetaCodable\/IgnoreEncoding(if:)-1iuvv","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"IgnoreEncoding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"if"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"repeat"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"each"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T","preciseIdentifier":"s:11MetaCodable1TL_xmfp"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/metacodable\/ignoreencoding(if:)-1iuvv","abstract":[{"text":"Indicates the field\/case needs to be encoded only if provided condition","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is not satisfied.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"IgnoreEncoding(if:)"},"https://github.com/SwiftyLab/MetaCodable/issues/56":{"title":"#56","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/SwiftyLab\/MetaCodable\/issues\/56","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"#56"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/SwiftyLab\/MetaCodable\/issues\/56"},"https://github.com/apple/swift-package-manager/issues/6003":{"type":"link","title":"this bug","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-package-manager\/issues\/6003","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this bug"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-package-manager\/issues\/6003"},"https://github.com/apple/swift-evolution/blob/main/proposals/0407-member-macro-conformances.md":{"title":"Swift 5.9.2","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-evolution\/blob\/main\/proposals\/0407-member-macro-conformances.md","titleInlineContent":[{"code":"Swift 5.9.2","type":"codeVoice"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-evolution\/blob\/main\/proposals\/0407-member-macro-conformances.md"},"doc://MetaCodable/documentation/MetaCodable/Codable(commonStrategies:)":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"macro","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Codable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"commonStrategies","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"CodableCommonStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier"